        "Still in the fight are NAVI, who want to keep their unbroken Major attendance streak alive, and FaZe, who missed the IEM Cologne Major this summer. In the Americas, NRG, Wildcard, DENDELE and Imperial are battling for the last places. Key points are still up for grabs at PGL Masters Bucharest."
